  "brain_first": "“不要等选项原词出现；听意思。”",
  "sort_order": 1012,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 537
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "录音与选项意思相同但用词不同，例如",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 538
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "inexpensive → affordable; decide not to go →",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 539
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "cancel。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 540
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 541
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同义替换是听力和阅读共同的核心能力。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 542
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “不要等选项原词出现；听意思。”",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 543
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 命题人若把原句原词直接搬到正确选项，题目会太容易，因此常换表达方式。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 544
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 545
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 看选项，先用中文/简单英语概括每个选项的核心意思。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 546
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 听录音时匹配“意思”，而不是字面。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 547
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 特别注意否定换表达：hardly / rarely / failed to / no longer。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 548
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 听到近义改写时立即在选项旁打勾。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 549
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 550
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 551
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 552
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· cheap ↔ affordable",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 553
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· delay ↔ put off / postpone",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 554
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· choose not to ↔ decide against",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 555
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· be unable to ↔ cannot manage to",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 556
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 某个选项与录音意思一致，即使没有同词。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 557
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 如果三个选项都有熟词，优先比较核心动作和方向，不纠结单个词。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 558
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 559
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The repair won't cost much. 与 The repair is inexpensive. 意思一致。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 560
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 561
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “没听到选项原词”就排除。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 562
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只做词对词匹配。",
      "sourcePage": 20,
      "sourceIndex": 563
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 564
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 动作相同吗？",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 565
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 肯定/否定方向相同吗？",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 566
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 程度有没有被放大？",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 567
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 568
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 569
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 570
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 听原意，不等原词。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 571
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 573
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. inexpensive ↔ ?",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 574
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. put off ↔ ?",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 575
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. decide not to attend ↔ ?",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 576
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. no longer available ↔ ?",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 577
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 同义替换时还要检查哪些方向？",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 578
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. affordable/cheap；2. delay/postpone；3. cancel/choose not to go；4. not available anymore；",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 579
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 肯否、程度、主语/对象。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 580
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L9 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L9”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 581
    }
  ],
